  "instance_name": "boxing_day_pun_mapping",
  "label": "Boxing Day Holiday is mapped onto boxing gloves and gift box",
  "description": "The text 'international boxing day' creates an analogical mapping by conflating the holiday 'Boxing Day' (which involves gift-giving) with the sport of boxing (symbolized by the red boxing gloves). The visual elements — the boxing gloves and the gift box — are mapped onto the dual meaning of 'boxing' in the text. The gift box represents the gift-giving aspect of the holiday, while the boxing gloves represent the sport. This mapping is central to the pun and humor of the meme.",
